residents='''<main id="main" class="subpage"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="section-label">02 / THE PEOPLE WE MEET</p><h1>来客与居民</h1></div><p>外表是你带来的第一句话。<br>但它不会替你决定，应该相信谁。</p></div><section class="character-stage" aria-label="可选择的角色外观"><div class="character-portrait"><img id="character-image" src="assets/characters/traveller.png" width="180" height="270" alt="旅人像素形象"><span class="character-no" aria-hidden="true">01</span></div><div class="character-profile" id="character-profile" aria-live="polite"><p class="section-label">VISITOR / 可选外观</p><h2 id="character-name">旅人</h2><h3 id="character-subtitle">一张单程车票</h3><p id="character-description">提着旧皮箱来到雾汐镇。陌生的街道，等待你亲眼看清。</p><div class="character-note">外观选择与派系分开。<br>这些身份没有额外的专属战斗能力。</div></div></section><div class="character-tabs" role="group" aria-label="切换来客形象">CHARACTER_TABS</div><section class="paper-section"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="section-label">A TOWN WITH ITS OWN ROUTINE</p><h2>小镇有自己的作息。</h2></div><p>在店铺、工坊和田边遇见居民。入夜以后，街道渐渐安静下来。</p></div><div class="resident-row">RESIDENTS</div></section></main>'''.replace('CHARACTER_TABS',tabs)
